# Local tool state and generated source dumps
.workbuddy/
dart_sources.md
repomix-output.*

# Local archive of third-party reference sources (~88 MB, untracked by intent).
# Not a pubspec dependency and no code imports it; keeping it out of the repo
# avoids a one-way 88 MB commit. Do not `git add -A` at the repository root.
/_archive_project/

# Vendored third-party UI reference clone, intentionally untracked.
# It is not a pubspec dependency and no code imports it; keep provenance and
# pinned version in the ADR instead of 5.7 MB of upstream history.
# See docs/adr/ADR-0001-dep-vendored-shadcn-ui.md before deleting or re-adding.
/packages/flutter-shadcn-ui/
